  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrating key stakeholders for the effective implementation of a multi-hazard early warning system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">aims to complement the PER-RS-007 GCF readiness grant by generating strategic frameworks to enhance local and inclusive governance of MHEWS in Peru for climate resilience. For this purpose, the proposal will foster active and inclusive participation and co-leadership of a wide range of stakeholders, particularly local communities (peasant and native), Indigenous Peoples and the private sector, adopting gender, intercultural and intergenerational approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
